<div class="cd-hero-t"><p class="cd-k">An independent guide to fine calfskin bags</p><h1>Soft as<br><span class="cd-scr">a whisper,</span><br>strong for years.</h1><p class="cd-lead">Calfdom is a guide to the leather behind the world&rsquo;s most loved handbags. Find the calfskin finish that suits your life, plan a bag that holds exactly what you carry, and learn to keep it beautiful.</p>
<div class="cd-hero-a"><a class="cd-btn" href="#finish">Find my finish</a><a class="cd-lnk" href="#fit">Plan my bag size</a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cd-s cd-fn" id="finish"><div class="cd-w"><div class="cd-sh"><p class="cd-k">Atelier tool &middot; I</p><h2 class="rv">Calfskin finish finder</h2><p class="cd-p">Calfskin comes in many finishes, each with its own look and temperament. Tell us how you use a bag and we suggest the finish that will age the way you want.</p></div>
<div class="cd-fn-g"><div class="cd-fq"><fieldset><legend>How will you use it?</legend><div class="cd-op" data-q="0"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Every day, everywhere</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Work and travel</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Evenings and occasions</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Your climate</legend><div class="cd-op" data-q="1"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Often rainy</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Mixed</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Mostly dry</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>You want a bag that&hellip;</legend><div class="cd-op" data-q="2"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Holds a crisp shape</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Feels soft and relaxed</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Has a velvety touch</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Marks and scratches&hellip;</legend><div class="cd-op" data-q="3"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Should barely show</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Can add character</button><button type="button" data-v="2">I will be careful</button></div></fieldset></div><div class="cd-swatch" aria-live="polite"><div class="cd-sw-v" id="fn-sw"></div><div class="cd-sw-t"><p class="cd-scr" id="fn-k">our suggestion</p><h3 id="fn-t"></h3><p id="fn-d"></p><dl class="cd-bars"><div><dt>Scratch resistance</dt><dd><i id="fn-b0"></i></dd></div><div><dt>Rain tolerance</dt><dd><i id="fn-b1"></i></dd></div><div><dt>Holds its shape</dt><dd><i id="fn-b2"></i></dd></div><div><dt>Softness</dt><dd><i id="fn-b3"></i></dd></div></dl></div><figure class="cd-sw-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788178320145-303fe8c9a41a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=200&q=75" alt="cream-coloured leather with a fine grain" width="300" height="200" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cd-s cd-ft2" id="fit"><div class="cd-w cd-fit-g"><div><p class="cd-k">Atelier tool &middot; II</p><h2 class="rv">Bag capacity planner</h2><p class="cd-p">Tick what you carry on a normal day. We estimate the space you need and suggest a bag style and minimum size, so you never buy a beautiful bag that will not close.</p><div class="cd-its"><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="phone" data-v="1" checked><span>Phone</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="wallet" data-v="1" checked><span>Wallet</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="keys" data-v="1" checked><span>Keys</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="glasses" data-v="1" checked><span>Sunglasses</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="pouch" data-v="2"><span>Small pouch</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="bottle" data-v="3"><span>Water bottle</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="umbrella" data-v="3"><span>Compact umbrella</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="tablet" data-v="4"><span>Tablet / book</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="folder" data-v="6"><span>A4 folder</span></label><label class="cd-it"><input type="checkbox" value="laptop" data-v="7"><span>13-inch laptop</span></label></div><figure class="cd-fit-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621985191560-99df9ed0564a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=260&q=75" alt="a grey leather bag on a white table" width="520" height="260" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="cd-box-w" aria-live="polite"><div class="cd-box" id="ft-box"><div class="cd-box-h"></div><div class="cd-box-in" id="ft-in"></div></div><p class="cd-scr" id="ft-k">your bag</p><h3 id="ft-t"></h3><p class="cd-dim" id="ft-d"></p><p class="cd-p" id="ft-n"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="cd-s cd-col"><div class="cd-w"><div class="cd-col-h"><h2 class="rv">Four silhouettes in calfskin</h2><figure class="cd-hw"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758297679736-2e6ff92d2021?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=220&q=75" alt="a shiny gold buckle on a reflective surface" width="640" height="220" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Hardware: polished, never loud</figcaption></figure></div><div class="cd-col-g"><article class="cd-pc rv"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623934873142-4bdb137d64eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=480&q=75" alt="a brown leather handbag on a pink drawer" width="380" height="480" loading="lazy"></figure><span class="cd-pc-n">I</span><b>The everyday tote</b><p>Smooth calf, open top, room for a day.</p></article><article class="cd-pc rv"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657603478564-0dfdd438e426?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=480&q=75" alt="a brown leather bag" width="380" height="480" loading="lazy"></figure><span class="cd-pc-n">II</span><b>The soft hobo</b><p>Slouchy, light and easy on the shoulder.</p></article><article class="cd-pc rv"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657603471016-b3c13c3b5ff5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=480&q=75" alt="a brown leather purse" width="380" height="480" loading="lazy"></figure><span class="cd-pc-n">III</span><b>The structured purse</b><p>Box-like shape that holds its lines.</p></article><article class="cd-pc rv"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1793993554189-8a4f6191b171?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=480&q=75" alt="a hand holding a black crossbody bag" width="380" height="480" loading="lazy"></figure><span class="cd-pc-n">IV</span><b>The crossbody</b><p>Hands free, close to the body.</p></article></div></div></section>

